{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Ada Script Diagnostics and Performance","modules":[{"name":"Ada Script"}],"role":"article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS"],"title":"ECS Integration","anchor":"ECS-Integration"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Compilation diagnostics","anchor":"Compilation-diagnostics"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","type":"reference"},{"text":" compiles the source and reads declaration metadata","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without executing a ","type":"text"},{"code":"main()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" manifest. Initialization throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptError\/compilation(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" for syntax or semantic errors and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptError\/invalidManifest(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" for invalid AdaEngine annotations.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Examples include "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@system"},{"type":"text","text":" on a non-class declaration, duplicate system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifiers, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@query"},{"type":"text","text":" outside a system class, a query with no fetched"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components, and a system class that cannot be initialized."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Setup diagnostics","anchor":"Setup-diagnostics"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Native component identifiers are resolved during plugin setup so earlier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plugins can register game components. Unknown or ambiguous component names skip"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the affected system and append a diagnostic."}]},{"anchor":"Runtime-diagnostics","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Runtime diagnostics"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Runtime diagnostics include unknown component aliases, unknown fields,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unsupported values, invalid numeric conversions, and query capabilities used","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"outside their callback lifetime.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Inspect ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin\/diagnostics"},{"text":" after setup and during development.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"System ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update(context)"},{"text":" callbacks are command-style; their return values are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ignored. Tests should assert observable ECS state and diagnostics.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Performance-model","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Performance model"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ada Script query execution traverses native archetypes and chunks. Component"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"columns are bound once per chunk, and field access advances a typed pointer by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"row stride. A successful write mutates the component in place and updates its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change tick."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The hot path avoids arrays of matched entity identifiers, one Swift bridge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"object per entity, repeated entity-location lookups, existential component"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"copies, and whole-component reinsertion."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current embedded C runtime is globally shared and non-reentrant, so runtime entry remains"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"serialized. Scalability comes from native filtering, column iteration, cached"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"metadata, and narrow bridge calls rather than multiple concurrent VMs."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Benchmark scripting changes with multiple archetypes and chunks and compare"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them with a typed Swift query. Validate semantics before drawing performance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conclusions."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptdiagnosticsandperformance"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptDiagnosticsAndPerformance","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Understand annotation, setup, and runtime failures and keep ECS work on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"native chunk path.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptError/compilation(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptError\/compilation(_:)","abstract":[],"title":"AdaScriptError.compilation(_:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascripterror\/compilation(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"compilation"},{"kind":"text","text":"